==English==

===Etymology===
From [[w:Greek|Greek]] '''[[lithos]]''' ''stone'' + '''[[sphere]]''' ''globe, ball'' (sphaira)

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
'''lithosphere'''

# {{geology}} The rigid, mechanically strong, outer layer of the [[Earth]]; divided into twelve major [[plate]]s

